<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index fell to 1,370.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index fell to 1,370.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Jan 29 Reuter - The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates fell to 1,370 today from 1,382 on Jan 28, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
